ext("C237", " Report 65 (Rabit): the garden is the retention mechanic (GAM_PLANT 21, mean 4.62; MOT_GOOD 21, 4.86 — 'ver minhas plantinhas crescendo me incentiva a continuar') and under-built — more plant varieties (3), a placeable garden 'more like FarmTown' with tap-a-plant-for-detail, a widget that shows the garden and warns when a plant is near death; 'the cheapest available investment in the thing people already love'.")
ext("C157", " Report 65 (Rabit): a missed habit kills the plant — 'Missing one scheduled habit completely kills a plant?!! … I don't mind a penalty but this is dark souls level'; 'are we supposed to lie?' — users accept the penalty when deserved and reject it when not, so plant death is 'the single riskiest design decision in the product'.")
